= Research references =

'''Status: Active external-reference index.''' Reviewed 2026-08-20.

This page preserves high-value external references used to design BITwiki navigation, contribution flows, administration, coverage priorities, accessibility/readability, comparative-wiki research, and security. Inclusion means ''worth studying''; it does not mean BITwiki adopts the source's rules.

== Reading rule ==

When a source is a Wikipedia/Wikimedia internal page, distinguish its status: policy, guideline, information/help page, WikiProject, proposal/draft, essay, category, article, or historical statistics. A category page is primarily an index into a body of project documentation, not a policy statement by itself.

